Z||000032||johnmac||09-01-2001||07:19 AM||||Hi Geyser,<P>Right on! Sometimes us "engineers" are a bunch of yo yos! <P>For sure it looks like the Pontiac Engineers did some foul ups for sure.<P>From the above comments, it appears some 87 GT models may have been wired correctly. I know of 3 Fieros , 1 85 & 2 86s that were not!<P><P>------------------<BR>John MacHaffie<BR>86GT "Yellowbird"<BR>12+ month project car<BR>johnmac@mpinet.net<BR>Winter Springs, Florida||||reg||1
